{"steam_appid":2020710,"steam_name":"Havendock","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2020710/2012298658/2270f1808b8d8210bf547cff88c1440df80b8fc6/1764172777/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1764173634","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257238799/67421de1a53d6490f73f672be87651be75d26c9e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1764173634","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2020710/ss_a4cc4c827f6ba46c5d1d2182fd661fc0da12ed4d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776258552","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2020710/ss_ce6d2800da64009af3c8b42cdc6d2cf3c35f446b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776258552","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2020710/ss_ad1b6f413b6e5c5da07af7296e445c0e7c0331d6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776258552","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2020710/ss_2cb249a2b24110c0fc01cf6c3c2308c777d1beaf.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776258552","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2020710/ss_832f324ce9de346f24b499eb70889c6ff7a79ef6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776258552"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Havendock is a cozy colony sim set in the heart of the ocean, where you’ll build a thriving town from the ground up. Welcome new settlers, manage resources, explore new lands, and live your best life. Lead your humble settlement into a high-tech society.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2020710/extras/f39b26a5317850cac3a6ea10a16141a4.avif?t=1776258552\" width=600 height=150 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2020710/extras/e06447b62b54369c2ccb20773e79acff.poster.avif?t=1776258552\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2020710/extras/e06447b62b54369c2ccb20773e79acff.webm?t=1776258552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2020710/extras/e06447b62b54369c2ccb20773e79acff.mp4?t=1776258552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own character. Collect resources from floating debris. Build facilities to become self-sufficient. Arrange your settlement the way you want and at your own pace. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2020710/extras/26bfff9dde15cff499517061c02baf28.avif?t=1776258552\" width=600 height=150 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2020710/extras/33d0e0518e06dec34771b57c17306dc2.poster.avif?t=1776258552\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2020710/extras/33d0e0518e06dec34771b57c17306dc2.webm?t=1776258552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2020710/extras/33d0e0518e06dec34771b57c17306dc2.mp4?t=1776258552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build farms to grow food and cook delicious meals.  Raise and feed animals – make adorable new friends, some of them will help make your settlement work more efficiently!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2020710/extras/b1c34694fd8e2bb49124702b31cbe000.avif?t=1776258552\" width=600 height=150 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2020710/extras/35801e60bfb31fd774defbd0654a2a15.poster.avif?t=1776258552\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2020710/extras/35801e60bfb31fd774defbd0654a2a15.webm?t=1776258552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2020710/extras/35801e60bfb31fd774defbd0654a2a15.mp4?t=1776258552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome new survivors – manage tasks and production to keep everyone happy and healthy. More settlers means more needs to be met, but don't worry. You'll teach your new pals how to work, and they'll help you automate the tasks you like less.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2020710/extras/dc1092ec41be0f2622070860c2ffa53a.avif?t=1776258552\" width=600 height=150 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2020710/extras/cd90e59295bbeac68b262f42cd280e70.poster.avif?t=1776258552\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2020710/extras/cd90e59295bbeac68b262f42cd280e70.webm?t=1776258552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2020710/extras/cd90e59295bbeac68b262f42cd280e70.mp4?t=1776258552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master mad science – push past the limits of modern engineering and common sense. From basic devices like water distiller or coffee maker to robots that help you further automate your work, power plants, submarine, and even… a rocket. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2020710/extras/f3452e336fe593e750ecf1bc0c563ace.avif?t=1776258552\" width=600 height=150 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2020710/extras/2646df11db7c76a8d1eee4c4346a3433.poster.avif?t=1776258552\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2020710/extras/2646df11db7c76a8d1eee4c4346a3433.webm?t=1776258552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2020710/extras/2646df11db7c76a8d1eee4c4346a3433.mp4?t=1776258552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build boats and discover islands looming on the horizon.  Jump into your submarine to explore the depths of the ocean, look for ores and oil, or build an underwater farm.</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual core 3 GHz+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 700 series or similar<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad core 3 GHz+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1050 series or similar<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Casual","Indie","Simulation","Strategy"],"developers":["YYZ Studio"],"publishers":["Pretty Soon","IndieArk"],"release_date":"22 Apr, 2025"}